{{Quote|Grants the user sharp spikes on their body, full of offensive attacks skills.|Shop}}
'''Spike''' is a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|180,000}} or {{Robux|380}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Spike allows the user to deploy spikes anywhere they choose to. The user can also transform their body into spikes, allowing them to damage opponents in close range.

